ICD-10
Codes and titles follow the WHO International Statistical Classification of
Diseases and Related Health Problems, 10th Revision (public identifiers).

RxNorm
Identifiers (RXCUI) are from RxNorm, a product of the U.S. National Library of
Medicine. This is a small subset; it is not a substitute for the RxNorm
release and is not endorsed by the NLM.

Verification (4 November 2026): every RxNorm code and name was checked against
the NLM RxNav API (RxNorm release 02-Nov-2026, shown as "RxNorm version" by
RxNav). Every LOINC code and long common name was checked against the NLM
Clinical Table Search Service for LOINC, which does not report a LOINC release
number, so the LOINC version is not pinned here.

No SNOMED CT content is included.
